    "title": "Summer Sizzler brings radio-controlled aircraft to Newport - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Hannah Hutter ,\n7 hours ago NEWPORT, N.C. (WITN) - Calling all plane enthusiasts, the Crystal Coast Radio Control Club will host its annual Summer Sizzler this weekend. The event will feature radio-controlled model airplanes of many types, including scale replicas of civilian and military aircraft from the past 100 years, helicopters, and model jets. Attendees can watch demonstrations and learn how to get involved in the hobby. Read full article\n1",
